{
  "_comment": [
    "Curated node vocabulary for the workflow prompts. EDIT THIS, not the",
    "generated tables in prompts/markdown/*.md.",
    "",
    "Why this file exists: gen_node_domains.py groups by SideFX #tags, and",
    "SideFX only populated those for SOPs (66% of pages). LOP coverage is 19%",
    "and materiallibrary carries no tag at all, so the tag path cannot produce",
    "the categories a lookdev or PDG task needs. The grouping here is therefore",
    "editorial. The names are not: gen_prompt_vocab.py checks every one against",
    "tools/node_versions.json and annotates version ranges, so an invented or",
    "removed name fails --check instead of shipping.",
    "",
    "cells has one entry per column after the label, so len(cells) is",
    "len(headers) - 1."
  ],
